OL,3,GNEWSABarber shop incident leaves man   
OL,4,Aseriously injured                      
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fattempted murder after another man was 
OL,8,Fseriously injured at a barber shop in  
OL,9,FWorcestershire.                        
OL,11,FWest Mercia Police were called to      
OL,12,FEmpire Barbers on Deansway, Worcester, 
OL,13,Fat about 15:15 GMT on Wednesday        
OL,14,Ffollowing reports that a man in his 30s
OL,15,Fhad been hurt.                         
OL,17,FHe was taken to hospital but his       
OL,18,Finjuries are not thought to be life    
OL,19,Fthreatening or life changing, police   
OL,20,Fsaid.                                  
